        "text": "Facelift surgery is one of the most comprehensive procedures of today's aesthetic surgery, surgically eliminating the sagging, lines, and volume loss that aging leaves on the face and neck area and offering the most permanent results. This operation, also known as a face-neck lift, not only tightens the skin; it also repositions the tissue structure in the deep layers of the face, providing a longer-lasting and more natural rejuvenation."
