        "text": "Facelift surgery may come into question not only due to advanced age, but also as a result of loss of skin elasticity that can start at early ages, genetic predisposition, or lifestyle factors. The following signs strengthen face-neck lift candidacy:<br>• Pronounced sagging in the cheek and midface area<br>• Loosening of the jawline and the formation of jowls<br>• Deep banding and sagging in the neck<br>• Blurring of the neck-jaw line<br>• Skin sagging in the temple and forehead area<br>• Advanced sagging pictures where non-invasive methods such as Botox and fillers are no longer sufficient"
