        "text": "• Eyelid aesthetics (blepharoplasty): Completes the rejuvenation on the face, giving the gaze a rested and awake expression.<br>• Facial fat injection: Simultaneously filling the volume loss while the sagging is removed produces a more balanced and fuller result. This transfer, obtained from the person's own fat, provides a completely natural fullness.<br>• Eyebrow lift (endoscopic forehead lift): Eliminating the sagging in the forehead and brow area completes the upper-face effect of the facelift.<br>• Botox and filler applications: Can be used to manage fine lines after surgery and preserve facial balance.<br>• Skin renewal (laser, PRP): Supports the structural rejuvenation achieved by surgery in terms of skin quality."
